<h3 data-start="2344" data-end="2385"><strong data-start="2348" data-end="2385">Step 2. Spiral Sweep Construction</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2386" data-end="2516">Let φ = 137.50776° (the golden angle).<br data-start="2424" data-end="2427">
