</li>
<li data-start="11387" data-end="11523">
<p data-start="11389" data-end="11523"><strong data-start="11389" data-end="11429">2-opt behavior and crossing removal:</strong> analyses of 2-opt dynamics and crossing-free tours. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://www.roeglin.org/publications/SODA07.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.roeglin.org/publications/SODA07.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">roeglin.org</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="11524" data-end="11649">
<p data-start="11526" data-end="11649"><strong data-start="11526" data-end="11547">Sweep heuristics:</strong> angular ordering as a simple geometric constructive family. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1901.02771?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1901.02771?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">arXiv</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="11650" data-end="11813">
