<p data-start="745" data-end="769"><strong data-start="745" data-end="769">What the runner does</strong></p>
<ul data-start="770" data-end="1151">
<li data-start="770" data-end="861">
<p data-start="772" data-end="861">Datasets: uniform, clustered Gaussians, grid+jitter (auto-selects square sizes for grid).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="862" data-end="931">
<p data-start="864" data-end="931">Baselines: GAO, NN, Sweep, CI — all passed through identical 2-opt.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="932" data-end="1055">
<p data-start="934" data-end="1055">Metrics per run: <code data-start="951" data-end="1054">build_time_ms, opt_time_ms, init_length, init_crossings, final_length, final_crossings, two_opt_moves</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1056" data-end="1151">
<p data-start="1058" data-end="1151">Reproducibility: fixed <code data-start="1081" data-end="1088">seeds</code> and <code data-start="1093" data-end="1100">sizes</code> in <code data-start="1104" data-end="1115">runner.py</code>; adjust lists to scale experiments.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1153" data-end="1181">If you want, I can also add:</p>
<ul data-start="1182" data-end="1443" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">
<li data-start="1182" data-end="1266">
<p data-start="1184" data-end="1266">a small <code data-start="1192" data-end="1203">README.md</code> with figures showing NN vs GAO step-by-step on a toy instance,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1267" data-end="1294">
<p data-start="1269" data-end="1294">a <code data-start="1271" data-end="1278">--tsv</code>/<code data-start="1279" data-end="1288">--jsonl</code> flag,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1295" data-end="1443" data-is-last-node="">
<p data-start="1297" data-end="1443" data-is-last-node="">or a <code data-start="1302" data-end="1312">plots.py</code> (matplotlib) to visualize crossings and convergence (no styles/colors set unless you ask). <span class="align-middle" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Coding Citation" class="rounded-xl px-1 bg-token-interactive-bg-tertiary-press text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-inverted hover:bg-token-interactive-bg-primary-selected"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-sm"><path d="M12.0394 5.92117C12.451 6.12699 12.6179 6.62755 12.412 7.0392L9.07871 13.7059C8.87289 14.1175 8.37232 14.2844 7.96068 14.0785C7.54903 13.8727 7.38217 13.3722 7.588 12.9605L10.9213 6.29385C11.1272 5.8822 11.6277 5.71534 12.0394 5.92117ZM5.50002 5.99986C5.86821 6.276 5.94283 6.79833 5.66669 7.16652L3.54169 9.99986L5.66669 12.8332C5.94283 13.2014 5.86821 13.7237 5.50002 13.9999C5.13183 14.276 4.6095 14.2014 4.33335 13.8332L1.83335 10.4999C1.61113 10.2036 1.61113 9.79615 1.83335 9.49986L4.33335 6.16652C4.6095 5.79833 5.13183 5.72371 5.50002 5.99986ZM14.5 5.99986C14.8682 5.72371 15.3905 5.79833 15.6667 6.16652L18.1667 9.49986C18.3889 9.79615 18.3889 10.2036 18.1667 10.4999L15.6667 13.8332C15.3905 14.2014 14.8682 14.276 14.5 13.9999C14.1318 13.7237 14.0572 13.2014 14.3334 12.8332L16.4584 9.99986L14.3334 7.16652C14.0572 6.79833 14.1318 6.276 14.5 5.99986Z"></path></svg></button></span></p>
