<p data-start="4766" data-end="4789"><strong data-start="4766" data-end="4789">Trade-offs summary:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="4790" data-end="5119">
<li data-start="4790" data-end="4945">
<p data-start="4792" data-end="4945"><em data-start="4792" data-end="4812">Speed vs. quality:</em> NN and Sweep build fastest but need heavy 2-opt cleanup. GAO builds slower than NN but faster than CI, and converges faster overall.</p>
