<p data-start="4948" data-end="5039"><em data-start="4948" data-end="4975">Crossings vs. refinement:</em> Fewer initial crossings ⇒ fewer 2-opt moves ⇒ shorter opt_time.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5040" data-end="5119">
<p data-start="5042" data-end="5119"><em data-start="5042" data-end="5069">Stability vs. randomness:</em> GAO is deterministic; NN varies with start point.</p>
</li>
</ul>
