ch literature and did <strong data-start="57" data-end="64">not</strong> locate any prior work that clearly matches your proposed heuristic — i.e., a tour-construction algorithm that uses a fixed golden-angle rotation increment and then picks the nearest unvisited point in that angular direction. Below is a detailed summary, including relevant references I found, and how they compare (or don’t) to your algorithm.</p>
