<h3 data-start="3556" data-end="3575">🔍 What changed</h3>
<ol data-start="3577" data-end="4038">
<li data-start="3577" data-end="3759">
<p data-start="3580" data-end="3609"><strong data-start="3580" data-end="3609">Validation &amp; repair block</strong></p>
<ul data-start="3613" data-end="3759">
<li data-start="3613" data-end="3656">
<p data-start="3615" data-end="3656">Ensures each vertex appears exactly once.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3660" data-end="3702">
<p data-start="3662" data-end="3702">Appends any unvisited points at the end.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3706" data-end="3759">
<p data-start="3708" data-end="3759">Asserts validity so errors are visible immediately.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="3761" data-end="3917">
<p data-start="3764" data-end="3792"><strong data-start="3764" data-end="3792">Safer candidate handling</strong></p>
<ul data-start="3796" data-end="3917">
<li data-start="3796" data-end="3917">
<p data-start="3798" data-end="3917">If both <code data-start="3806" data-end="3821">pop_candidate</code> and <code data-start="3826" data-end="3838">candidates</code> fail, it picks <em data-start="3854" data-end="3869">any remaining</em> unvisited index instead of leaving <code data-start="3905" data-end="3916">cand=None</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="3919" data-end="4038">
<p data-start="3922" data-end="3942"><strong data-start="3922" data-end="3942">No silent breaks</strong></p>
<ul data-start="3946" data-end="4038">
<li data-start="3946" data-end="4038">
<p data-start="3948" data-end="4038">The old <code data-start="3956" data-end="3963">break</code> could end early and return a partial tour; now we always output length =n.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
