"2789" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2776" data-end="2788">Ecologia</strong></td><td data-start="2789" data-end="2845" data-col-size="md">angular rhythm coherence (Δθ near 137°, low variance)</td><td data-start="2845" data-end="2884" data-col-size="md">near 1 = healthy golden-angle rhythm</td><td data-start="2884" data-end="2893" data-col-size="sm">0.6–1</td></tr><tr data-start="2894" data-end="2975"><td data-start="2894" data-end="2908" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2896" data-end="2907">Overall</strong></td><td data-start="2908" data-end="2928" data-col-size="md">mean of the above</td><td data-start="2928" data-end="2966" data-col-size="md">synthetic “spiral health” indicator</td><td data-start="2966" data-end="2975" data-col-size="sm">0.6–1</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 1