<h2 data-start="2550" data-end="2578">⚙️ 4. How to formalize it</h2>
<p data-start="2580" data-end="2640">You could define a <strong data-start="2599" data-end="2634">Coherence Benchmark Suite (CBS)</strong> with:</p>
