<h2 data-start="1234" data-end="1288">🧠 2. Why visuals looked better than Ecologia score</h2>
<p data-start="1290" data-end="1531">The <em data-start="1294" data-end="1299">eye</em> notices average alignment with the golden-angle line; the metric penalizes both bias <strong data-start="1385" data-end="1392">and</strong> variance.<br data-start="1402" data-end="1405">
A few large deviations (&gt; ±40°) inflate the denominator, driving the score down.<br data-start="1485" data-end="1488">
