" data-end="215">Great plan: strengthen <strong data-start="23" data-end="36">Adaptatio</strong> first (smooth, consistent radial steps), then the rest will follow. Here are <strong data-start="114" data-end="146">practical, test-ready tweaks</strong> you can drop into GAO, plus a mini test matrix to compare scenarios.</p>
