<h2 data-start="1745" data-end="1796">B) Two-stage choice (quantile filter then angle)</h2>
<p data-start="1797" data-end="1983"><strong data-start="1797" data-end="1806">Idea:</strong> among nearby-in-radius points, keep only the <strong data-start="1852" data-end="1871">best q-quantile</strong> by |Δr|, <em data-start="1881" data-end="1887">then</em> pick the smallest angular deviation.<br data-start="1924" data-end="1927">
<strong data-start="1927" data-end="1935">Why:</strong> softens oscillations without over-constraining.</p>
