<h2 data-start="860" data-end="906">🧩 2. Interpretation by Blueprint heuristic</h2>
<h3 data-start="908" data-end="937"><strong data-start="912" data-end="937">Dualitas (≈0.93–0.94)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="938" data-end="1108">Stable across all — good!<br data-start="963" data-end="966">
