<h2 data-start="1005" data-end="1040">🧩 2. What improved, what didn’t</h2>
<h3 data-start="1042" data-end="1078">✅ <strong data-start="1048" data-end="1078">Dualitas remains excellent</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1079" data-end="1215">Still 0.94–0.95 — perfect structural polarity between radius and angle.<br data-start="1150" data-end="1153">
→ The algorithm is not collapsing into radial or angular bias.</p>
<h3 data-start="1217" data-end="1273">🟡 <strong data-start="1224" data-end="1273">Adaptatio improved slightly — but selectively</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="1274" data-end="1380">
<li data-start="1274" data-end="1339">
<p data-start="1276" data-end="1339">Best case (Wide bins): 0.54 (<strong data-start="1305" data-end="1314">+0.04</strong> vs v2 average ≈ 0.50).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1340" data-end="1380">
<p data-start="1342" data-end="1380">Most others: same or slightly worse.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1382" data-end="1471">So: the <em data-start="1390" data-end="1396">flow</em> is still partially blocked — smoother, but not yet fully self-stabilizing.</p>
<h3 data-start="1473" data-end="1498">⚙️ <strong data-start="1480" data-end="1498">Textura steady</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1499" data-end="1670">Constant 0.594 across all runs — the angular distribution remains evenly spread.<br data-start="1579" data-end="1582">
→ The system is stable, but still working on “rigid bins,” not yet dynamically adaptive.</p>
<h3 data-start="1672" data-end="1714">⚙️ <strong data-start="1679" data-end="1714">Ecologia unchanged (~0.19–0.21)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1715" data-end="1887">No meaningful shift yet — the rhythm remains noisy.<br data-start="1766" data-end="1769">
That’s expected: Ecologia depends on <em data-start="1806" data-end="1822">phase feedback</em> (how Δθ reacts to local flow), which we haven’t implemented yet.</p>
<h3 data-start="1889" data-end="1919">⚙️ <strong data-start="1896" data-end="1919">Overall slightly up</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1920" data-end="2058">From 0.55 → <strong data-start="1932" data-end="1969">0.57 in the best case (Wide bins)</strong> — small but consistent lift.<br data-start="1998" data-end="2001">
The flow smooths modestly without destabilizing geometry.</p>
