</span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="4150" data-end="4229">→ larger radial jumps = slightly smaller angular step → smoother global spiral.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4231" data-end="4323">
<p data-start="4234" data-end="4323"><strong data-start="4234" data-end="4263">Add local rhythmic memory</strong> (short EMA of Δθ) — creates an “ecological resonance loop.”</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4325" data-end="4417">
<p data-start="4328" data-end="4417">Keep 2D bins (they’re solid) but use them more dynamically (skip empty bands adaptively).</p>
</li>
</ol>
