<p data-start="9195" data-end="9340">Then re-run your <strong data-start="9212" data-end="9222">Cell 3</strong>/<strong data-start="9223" data-end="9233">Cell 4</strong> flow with <code data-start="9244" data-end="9257">run_v3(...)</code> to print the coherence table and see the uplift in <strong data-start="9309" data-end="9322">Adaptatio</strong> and <strong data-start="9327" data-end="9339">Ecologia</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="9342" data-end="9345">
<h2 data-start="9347" data-end="9382">Tips if you want to tune further</h2>
<ul data-start="9384" data-end="9695">
<li data-start="9384" data-end="9476">
<p data-start="9386" data-end="9476">If <strong data-start="9389" data-end="9401">Ecologia</strong> is still sluggish, increase <code data-start="9430" data-end="9439">k_phase</code> to 0.55 (keep <code data-start="9454" data-end="9465">phi_clamp</code> at 0.2).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9477" data-end="9535">
<p data-start="9479" data-end="9535">If <strong data-start="9482" data-end="9495">Adaptatio</strong> doesn’t move, increase <code data-start="9519" data-end="9524">k_r</code> to 0.45.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9536" data-end="9606">
<p data-start="9538" data-end="9606">If you see over-tight packing in dense zones, drop <code data-start="9589" data-end="9596">k_den</code> to 0.1.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9607" data-end="9695">
<p data-start="9609" data-end="9695">If any metric oscillates wildly across seeds, make EMAs smoother (<code data-start="9675" data-end="9693">ema_*_beta = 0.9</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="9697" data-end="9865">Ping me with your new table when it’s done, and we’ll decide whether to push Ecologia further or freeze the settings and move on to performance/2-opt convergence tests.</p>
